GUITAR PRO 5.1 TRANSLATION FILE

### PATCH CONFIGURATION ###
AUTHOR NAMES = "Csaba Hencz"
AUTHOR E-MAIL = "cshencz@yahoo.com"
VERSION = "5.1"
AUTOMATIC SHORTCUTS
ENCODING = "WindowsLatin2"
###########################

You can use this file to create your own translation file for Guitar Pro.
To do it, translate ONLY the words between the symbols " ". DON'T CHANGE
ANYTHING ELSE. Note that the symbols %s, %t... are used to indicate a dynamic value,
which will be attribuated at running, so do not change it.

The words between the symbols { } are some indications to help you to
understand the context, don't change it.

After having changing the translations, save the file under your language
name with the extension .gpl (ie "English.gpl"). Place it in the
Guitar Pro directory, restart Guitar Pro and you'll have the new language
proposed in the menu OPTIONS | LANGUAGE.

Don't hesitate to send us your translation files, we'll add them on the site
for other users.

